{
  "item": "IronWheel01",
  "mu_name": "Iron Wheel",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_IRON_WHEEL (57), drawn as MONSTER_MODEL_GOLDEN_WHEEL = 41 (_enum.h:4191), so OpenMonsterModel loads Monster42.bmd -- the Golden Wheel (83) wears the same body. OpenMU Version095d Maps/Tarkan.cs:261 names breed 57 'Iron Wheel'. docs/tarkan-port.md.",
  "world": "tarkan",
  "object_type": 57,
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 41,
    "scale": 1.4
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13759-13768, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_IRON_WHEEL: OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_GOLDEN_WHEEL); Scale = 1.4f; Weapon[0].Type = MODEL_AQUAGOLD_CROSSBOW. Two BITMAP_JOINT_ENERGY eye trails (CreateMonster) and MU's sand smoke on its walk and death (MonsterMoveSandSmoke/MonsterDieSandSmoke) are not drawn yet, as the Mutant's and the Bloody Wolf's are not. Its three MODEL_ARROW_BOMB shots (straight and +-20 degrees, :1859-1878) are the realm's ranged attack, one bolt.",
  "right_hand": "CrossBow07",
  "right_hand_bone": "Bone04",
  "right_hand_from": "MODEL_AQUAGOLD_CROSSBOW is Item/CrossBow07.bmd, cooked. Its bone is CreateCharacter's weapon switch: `case MODEL_GOLDEN_WHEEL: c->Weapon[0].LinkBone = 23` (ZzzCharacter.cpp:11989-11990), Bone04 in Monster42.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "Exported with --actions=all, 7 actions, 49 bones. BoneHead 3 (ZzzOpenData.cpp:3679-3684). Walk at 0.18, OpenMonsterModel's walk override for model 41 (ZzzOpenData.cpp:2632), already in actions.json.",
  "sheets": {
    "wheel": "ironwheel_wheel.png",
    "w": "ironwheel_w.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Monster's wheel.OZJ (256 square, the rider's armour, 1134 triangles) and w.OZJ (256 square, the wheel, 172), under an ironwheel_ prefix.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "wheel": "painted_steel",
    "w": "wrought_iron"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "Read off the art: wheel is dark blue-grey plate with gold trim, a skull boss and a gold mask -- painted armour, painted_steel; w is the wheel's weathered brown face with a studded iron rim and a round iron boss -- wrought_iron.",
  "sounds_from": "ZzzOpenData.cpp:3679-3684: SetMonsterSound(..., 143, 143, 144, 144, 144): iron1 to move, iron_attack1 to attack and to die. Wired as ironwheel_* in sounds.json.",
